WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.340 --> 00:00:05.560
Well, I don’t know that I settled on football as such.

2
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:17.420
I went to high school and participated in all four of the senior team sports: football, baseball, basketball, and track at Terrebonne [High School].

3
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.080
As a matter of fact, I was the only four-year letterman at my high school.

4
00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.460
So I did it all.

5
00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:29.500
I guess had enough ability that LSU, or . . . you know, and I did well in football as well.

6
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.140
That’s where the scholarships were, and we were talked to by a number of schools,

7
00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.600
in the state and a few outside of the state for interest.

8
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.320
And that’s where the scholarships were.

9
00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:52.240
And if you remember my background, you know, my parents were humble people who had no means, who did not go to college.

10
00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:57.620
And, it was the way to go to advance yourself.

11
00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:06.440
But, predominantly, I have to admit, Scott, it was the fulfillment of the athletic dream, okay.

12
00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:10.700
That was as much a motivation as the academics.
